    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A hovering creature. mode hover keeps it floating hover_height (4) blocks above the first block with a shape below it, as a ghast or a blaze, with no gravity and no fall damage; wander drifts it about at that height. roost makes it hang upside down under a block within 8 blocks above it through the day (daylight true), as a bat, letting go when a player comes near. The ambient category spawns it in meadows and flower forests.",
